sequenceDiagram
    participant G as GUI
    participant S as skillm (check --json --events)
    participant R as Git remotes

    G->>S: spawn, read stdout line by line
    opt at least one skill installed
        S-->>G: event "batch" (items = every skill id; item i is items[i])
        par one per skill, concurrently
            S-->>G: event "item_start" (index, skill_id)
            opt git skill
                S->>R: read upstream Revision (no prompts)
                R-->>S: tree SHA, or failure
            end
            S-->>G: event "item_done" (index, level, code = status, text)
        end
    end
    alt finished
        S-->>G: "result" line: data {skills, updates}, error null, exit 0
    else cancelled (unresolved items get no item_done) or failed
        S-->>G: "result" line: data null, error {code, retryable}, exit non-zero
    end
